
---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Get to know The Desi Book Nook, a cozy corner for diverse reading lists, book recommendations, and honest opinions."
>
  <section class="wrap page-head">
    <h1>About The Desi Book Nook</h1>
    <p class="dek">Your cozy corner for chapters and chai.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap">
    <div class="measure prose">
      <p>
        Welcome to The Desi Book Nook, a little corner of the internet
        dedicated to books, stories, and the joy of finding your next
        favourite read.
      </p>

      <p>
        From YA romance and coming-of-age stories to mysteries,
        adventures, and everything in between, this is where I share
        reading lists for different moods, interests, and curiosities.
        Whether you're looking for a lighthearted read or a story
        that stays with you long after the last page, there's
        something here for you.
      </p>

      <h2>What you'll find here</h2>

      <p>
        Think of these lists as recommendations from a fellow reader.
        Each book comes with a short description and an honest take
        to help you decide whether it belongs on your reading list.
        No elaborate reviews or complicated literary analysis,
        just books worth talking about and stories worth discovering.
      </p>

      <h2>A note on recommendations</h2>

      <p>
        Every reader connects with a book differently, and that's
        part of the fun. The descriptions and opinions shared here
        are meant to give you a feel for a story, not tell you
        what you should or shouldn't enjoy.
      </p>

      <p>
        So grab your chai, get comfortable, and find your next read.
        Happy reading!
      </p>

      <p><a class="btn" href="/blog">Explore Reading Lists</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
